  "additional": {
    "aboutAssay": "",
    "forReview": "We observed a significant difference in OD values between the two ELISA runs performed on different days, raising concerns about the kit's reproducibility. The results were inconsistent both intra- and inter-experiment. The spike recovery and dilution linearity were poor. Based on these results, we are not confident that this kit can reliably measure leptin in equine serum."
